WEBVTT

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.920
last time on dragon ball z a mysterious stranger named trunks arrived from the future with a

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:16.120
warning for goku and his friends in three years time an evil scientist named dr gero will unleash

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:21.220
two deadly androids upon the earth and if events leading up to the attack are not changed the

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:30.000
consequences will be tragic for all of them and that's the good news trunks left to fight

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.900
the two deadly androids in his own time, leaving Goku and the others to prepare themselves

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:40.980
for the peril that most certainly lies ahead. It will require long hours of training and

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:46.140
discipline to get their bodies into the fighting shape necessary to defeat this unseen lethal

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:52.310
foe. While the others look toward a future that has already been written, Goku faces

00:01:52.310 --> 00:02:00.000
the daunting task of leading them all on a quest to change the fate of the world. Will

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.020
Android threat head-on.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.120
Can Goku prevent Tron's dark predictions

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.280
from coming to pass?

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.320
Only time will tell.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:44.370
He's so tough in that little capsule of his training at 300 times gravity.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:48.440
Well, I'll show him that he's not half as tough as he pretends to be.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:56.270
I'll show him that I can be just as tough as he is.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:59.670
5-par. I want to see what Vegeta's up to in there.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.980
by taking it to the limit, right young man?

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.750
- Shh, quiet more, keep your head down.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.870
- Geating gravity simulation, 300 times,

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.500
planets, normal gravity.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:35.440
- Program, level five.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.860
- Assuming defense formation.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:10.560
I'm the Saiyan! I'm the most powerful warrior in the universe!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.380
to radical training programs!

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:47.790
I guess it looks like we'll be working a bit late tonight, doesn't it, Kitty?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.600
Meow.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.390
Thank you, Vegeta.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:53.560
Hmm.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.120
Where Vegeta can take, I can take too!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:26.440
300 times normal gravity shouldn't be that tough.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.480
I'm sure I can handle it.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.360
Initiate gravity simulation.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:06.210
Oh.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:48.690
Sorry.

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.830
working so hard to get ready for those androids while I'm sitting around the

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:20.150
house doing nothing. I wish there was something I could do.

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:28.570
Ballmine! By the bakery today, look what I bought for us! Nice, huh? Don't these look scrumptious?

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:40.870
now which one do you want they're all yours mom I'm not very hungry what what's wrong with you

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:45.050
are you feeling lonely because all the boys are spending all their time training and not spending

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:54.070
time with you that's it isn't it dear oh please I'm just not very hungry you know I'm starting

00:08:54.070 --> 00:09:00.000
to think Vegeta's a few cards short of a full deck huh it wasn't enough

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.340
to have the simulator create 300 times gravity for him.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.140
Now he's demanding that I make some more equipment

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.320
for him to train with.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.920
And all he's going to do is break it.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:12.800
Somehow, that doesn't surprise me at all.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.820
Well, I think it's great he works so hard.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.020
Oh, sure, he's training hard,

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.200
but don't you think he's overdoing it a bit?

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.680
Oh, no, I think it's very admirable.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.770
In my day, a man that showed that much dedication

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.530
to anything was definitely husband material.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:30.000
I'll see you next time.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.430
A girl would have to raise you to let him get away, I tell you.

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:39.400
Oh my, what am I saying? I'm a married woman!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:58.260
I can't do this!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:46.090
this would happen. He's been trying to do the impossible!

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:52.880
Is he... Vegeta?

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:50.500
You've got to stop training for a while. I mean, look at you. You're a complete wreck.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:12:00.000
But I feel fine. I'm a Saiyan. I can take a little pain. It means nothing to me. And I have to get straight.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:05.620
than Kakarot okay sure we all know you're a tough guy but you need to rest

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:13.860
now I take orders from no one

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:42.910
they're moving so fast I can't even see them

00:13:42.910 --> 00:14:00.000
that's it

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:11.000
That's my boy.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:16.880
Is he going to be alright, Daddy?

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:21.990
I hope so. The only thing he hasn't bruised is his eyebrows.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:25.990
If he stays in bed for a week or so, he should be alright.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:30.000
He's dodged a bullet again. It's a miracle he survived.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:41.490
such a horrible accident those Saiyans are practically indestructible come on

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:45.630
dear let's let him rest

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:59.600
I'll beat you

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:01.840
He's having a bad dream.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:14.980
What are you saying?

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.710
*cough*

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:09.960
they're too fast i'll never be able to catch up with them

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:30.000
i'm the one with royal blood in my veins father Vegeta someday you will be

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.160
The strongest Saiyan in the universe!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.240
Father!

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:42.590
Ships are headed to distant galaxies.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:48.640
From the day we are born, we Saiyans are examined for our power and leadership.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:56.370
Weakest of our people are sent to planets far away where they face no threat from our enemies.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.670
Goodbye, Pess!

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:07.530
Vegeta, you come from a strong bloodline and you possess the potential power to join the super elite of all Saiyans.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:17.120
Never forget where you're from and train very hard, my son, because if you have proven yourself worthy, perhaps someday you will become a Super Saiyan.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:28.320
I haven't forgotten what you said, father. I haven't forgotten my destiny, and now I know that I will be stronger than Kakarot.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.240
Super Saiyan!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:48.840
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:37.000
UGH!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:43.320
It's time for us to get back to work!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:18.210
me woman leave me alone

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:33.220
Now go back to bed, some rest.

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:39.240
Not yet. I do have something to say.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:43.780
What? Is something wrong?

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:48.650
You're going to apologize to me, if that's spirit.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:50.580
ALONG!

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:18.700
Goku and his friends have only three short years to prepare themselves for the arrival

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.940
of Dr. Shiro's evil androids.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:23.130
And they plan to use every minute of it.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:27.030
But will these powerful new enemies still be too much for them to handle?

